  "imageName": "theatermasks",
  "intro": "Russian signals irony through grammar, not just tone. PARTICLES: -то (Умный-то он умный, но... - He's smart alright, but...), так называемый (so-called), якобы (supposedly). INTONATION MARKERS: Ну да! (Yeah right!), Как же! (As if!), Ещё чего! (No way!). DIMINUTIVES: Умненький! (Oh so clever! - mocking), Хорошенькое дело! (A fine mess!). REGISTER MISMATCH: Formal words for trivial things, slang for formal contexts. RHETORICAL QUESTIONS: Кто бы мог подумать? (Who would have thought? - obvious).",
