    "grammarFocus": "Concessive construction: X-то X, но...",
    "hints": [
      "This sarcastic/concessive construction repeats a verb with a particle in between, meaning 'sure he does X, BUT...' Which particle creates this pattern?"
    ],
    "explanations": [
      "The construction 'X-то X, но...' (verb-то verb, но...) is a concessive that grudgingly admits something while undermining it: 'Работать-то он работает, но без энтузиазма' (He does work, sure, but without enthusiasm). The particle -то creates this ironic concession."
